---
import PageLayout from "../../../components/PageLayout.astro";
---
<PageLayout lang="en" active="roadmap" title="Release Log — Linxira OS" maxWidth="860px">
  <h1>Release Log</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Archived ISO builds. The full release is built from source by users following the build guide — no fixed release date; test builds are archived here.</p>
  <div class="section-divider"></div>

  <div class="rel-item reveal">
    <div class="rel-head">
      <code class="rel-name">linxira-2026.08.14-x86_64.iso</code>
      <span class="tag latest">Latest</span>
      <span class="tag beta">Test</span>
    </div>
    <div class="rel-meta">2026-08-14 · 4.79 GB · SHA256 <code class="sha">b85ffcea99b39402470868a2d63d330613d12ec4068c57b92286a19e403bd145</code></div>
    <ul>
      <li>93 curated apps (catalog v3) across 14 categories; scientific computing and gaming ships by default</li>
      <li>Dual kernel (linux + linux-lts) with Timeshift / grub-btrfs snapshot rollback</li>
      <li>Containers by default: Podman / Distrobox / Apptainer / Docker out of the box</li>
      <li>Headless compute mode: linxira-config headless on/off — zero desktop overhead, all RAM for compute</li>
      <li>Signed [linxira] repository with 17 first-party tools; Chinese IME auto-configured by install language</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="rel-item reveal reveal-d1">
    <div class="rel-head">
      <code class="rel-name">linxira-2026.08.13-x86_64.iso</code>
      <span class="tag beta">Test</span>
    </div>
    <div class="rel-meta">2026-08-13 · 4.79 GB · SHA256 <code class="sha">b880391c29f96b6fc3c71d17be7ed6eb7248c6e0bb9021c6ccce522431f34d6b</code></div>
    <ul>
      <li>Incremental fixes over 08.12: boot / shutdown artwork and terminal char-art finalized</li>
      <li>All first-party software verified installable and launchable</li>
      <li>Signed repository update chain (pacman) trackable</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="rel-item reveal reveal-d2">
    <div class="rel-head">
      <code class="rel-name">linxira-2026.08.12-x86_64.iso</code>
      <span class="tag beta">Test</span>
    </div>
    <div class="rel-meta">2026-08-12 · 4.73 GB · SHA256 not separately archived</div>
    <ul>
      <li>Test baseline: KDE Plasma desktop + preinstalled software usable offline</li>
      <li>China mirror auto-fallback + [linxira] database pre-sync during install</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="rel-item reveal reveal-d3">
    <div class="rel-head">
      <code class="rel-name">linxira-2026.08.09-x86_64-r17.iso</code>
      <span class="tag rc">RC</span>
    </div>
    <div class="rel-meta">2026-08-09 · 4.69 GB</div>
    <ul>
      <li>17th iteration candidate: installer, branding and default app set converged</li>
      <li>Predecessor to the 08.12 test baseline</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:2.5rem;">
    <a href="/en/download/" class="cta-ghost">Download latest ISO →</a>
  </div>

  <style>
    .subtitle { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
    .rel-item { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30,41,59,0.6), rgba(14,20,23,0.8)); border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5); border-left: 3px solid var(--teal); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.3rem 1.5rem; margin: 1.2rem 0; }
    .rel-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .rel-name { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink-strong); background: none; padding: 0; }
    .rel-meta { color: var(--faint); font-size: 0.82rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
    .sha { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--soft); background: rgba(30,41,59,0.9); padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem; border-radius: 4px; word-break: break-all; }
    .tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 0.12rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 99px; font-weight: 600; }
    .tag.latest { background: rgba(32,184,176,0.2); color: #4DD8D0; }
    .tag.beta { background: rgba(234,179,8,0.15); color: #FACC15; }
    .tag.rc { background: rgba(148,163,184,0.15); color: #94a3b8; }
    .rel-item ul { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; padding-left: 1.2rem; margin: 0.3rem 0 0; }
    .cta-ghost { display: inline-block; padding: 0.85rem 1.8rem; color: var(--ink-strong); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; transition: all 0.2s; }
    .cta-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--teal); color: var(--teal); }
  </style>
</PageLayout>
